@startuml JDK 动态代理 RPC 调用完整时序图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

participant "客户端代码\n(TriggerWorkflowExecutorDelegate)" as ClientCode
participant "Clients" as Clients
participant "JdkDynamicRpcClientProxyFactory" as ProxyFactory
participant "Proxy\n(JDK)" as JDKProxy
participant "代理对象\n($Proxy0)" as ProxyObject
participant "ClientInvocationHandler" as ClientHandler
participant "SyncClientMethodInvoker" as ClientInvoker
participant "NettyRemotingClient" as RpcClient
participant "ResponseFuture" as Future
participant "Netty Channel\n(客户端)" as ClientChannel
participant "TCP 连接" as TCP
participant "Netty Channel\n(服务端)" as ServerChannel
participant "JdkDynamicServerHandler" as ServerHandler
participant "ServerMethodInvoker\n(ServerMethodInvokerImpl)" as ServerInvoker
participant "服务实现\n(WorkflowControlClient)" as ServiceImpl
participant "NettyClientHandler" as NettyHandler
participant "EventLoop 线程" as EventLoopThread

== 阶段1: 创建代理对象 ==

ClientCode -> Clients: withService(IWorkflowControlClient)
activate Clients
Clients -> ProxyFactory: getProxyClient(serverHost, interface)
activate ProxyFactory

ProxyFactory -> ProxyFactory: 检查缓存
alt 缓存未命中
    ProxyFactory -> JDKProxy: newProxyInstance(classLoader, interfaces, handler)
    activate JDKProxy
    note right of JDKProxy
      参数：
      - classLoader: IWorkflowControlClient.class.getClassLoader()
      - interfaces: [IWorkflowControlClient.class]
      - handler: ClientInvocationHandler
    end note
    note right of JDKProxy
      **JDK 动态生成代理类**
      1. 生成 $Proxy0 类
      2. 实现 IWorkflowControlClient 接口
      3. 所有方法都调用 InvocationHandler.invoke()
    end note
    JDKProxy -> ClientHandler: 创建 ClientInvocationHandler
    activate ClientHandler
    ClientHandler --> JDKProxy: InvocationHandler 对象
    deactivate ClientHandler
    JDKProxy --> ProxyFactory: 代理对象 ($Proxy0 实例)
    deactivate JDKProxy
    ProxyFactory -> ProxyFactory: 存入缓存
else 缓存命中
    ProxyFactory -> ProxyFactory: 从缓存获取
end

ProxyFactory --> Clients: 代理对象
deactivate ProxyFactory
Clients --> ClientCode: IWorkflowControlClient 代理对象
deactivate Clients

note over ClientCode, ProxyObject
  **代理对象创建完成**
  client 的实际类型是 $Proxy0
  实现了 IWorkflowControlClient 接口
end note

== 阶段2: 方法调用拦截 ==

ClientCode -> ProxyObject: manualTriggerWorkflow(request)
activate ProxyObject
note right of ProxyObject
  **JDK 动态生成的代理类方法**
  public WorkflowManualTriggerResponse manualTriggerWorkflow(...) {
      return (WorkflowManualTriggerResponse) h.invoke(
          this,
          method,
          new Object[]{request}
      );
  }
end note

ProxyObject -> ClientHandler: invoke(proxy, method, args)
activate ClientHandler

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 检查 @RpcMethod 注解
note right of ClientHandler
  **检查方法是否有 @RpcMethod 注解**
  method.getAnnotation(RpcMethod.class)
  如果有，转换为 RPC 调用
end note

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 检查方法调用器缓存
alt 缓存未命中
    ClientHandler -> ClientInvoker: 创建 SyncClientMethodInvoker
    activate ClientInvoker
    ClientInvoker --> ClientHandler: MethodInvoker 对象
    ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 存入缓存
else 缓存命中
    ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 从缓存获取
end

ClientHandler -> ClientInvoker: invoke(proxy, method, args)
activate ClientInvoker

== 阶段3: 构建 RPC 请求 ==

ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 获取 @RpcMethod 注解
note right of ClientInvoker
  **获取 @RpcMethod 注解信息**
  method.getAnnotation(RpcMethod.class)
  - timeout: 超时时间
  - retry: 重试策略
end note

ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 生成方法标识符
note right of ClientInvoker
  **方法标识符：**
  IWorkflowControlClient#manualTriggerWorkflow(WorkflowManualTriggerRequest)
end note

ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 序列化参数
note right of ClientInvoker
  **将方法参数序列化为 JSON**
  JsonSerializer.serialize(StandardRpcRequest.of(args))
end note

ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 构建 Transporter
note right of ClientInvoker
  **Transporter 包含：**
  - TransporterHeader: methodIdentifier, opaque
  - Body: 序列化后的参数
end note

ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 构建 SyncRequestDto
note right of ClientInvoker
  **SyncRequestDto 包含：**
  - transporter: 请求数据
  - serverHost: 服务端地址
  - timeoutMillis: 超时时间
  - retryStrategy: 重试策略
end note

ClientInvoker -> RpcClient: sendSync(syncRequestDto)
activate RpcClient

== 阶段4: 发送 RPC 请求 ==

RpcClient -> RpcClient: getOrCreateChannel(serverHost)
RpcClient -> ClientChannel: 获取或创建 Channel
activate ClientChannel
ClientChannel --> RpcClient: Channel 对象
deactivate ClientChannel

RpcClient -> Future: new ResponseFuture(opaque, timeout)
activate Future
note right of Future
  **创建 ResponseFuture**
  opaque = 1 (假设)
  FUTURE_TABLE.put(1, future)
end note
Future --> RpcClient: ResponseFuture

RpcClient -> ClientChannel: writeAndFlush(transporter)
activate ClientChannel
note right of ClientChannel
  **请求包含：**
  - opaque = 1
  - methodIdentifier = "IWorkflowControlClient#manualTriggerWorkflow(...)"
  - body = 序列化后的参数
end note

ClientChannel -> TCP: 发送数据（TCP）
activate TCP
TCP -> ServerChannel: 接收数据（TCP）
activate ServerChannel
ServerChannel --> TCP: 数据接收完成
deactivate ServerChannel
TCP --> ClientChannel: 发送完成
deactivate TCP
ClientChannel --> RpcClient: 发送成功（异步）
deactivate ClientChannel

RpcClient -> Future: waitResponse()
activate Future
note right of Future
  **业务线程阻塞等待响应**
  CountDownLatch.await()
  线程在此处阻塞
end note
Future --> RpcClient: (阻塞等待)
deactivate Future

== 阶段5: 服务端接收请求 ==

ServerChannel -> ServerHandler: channelRead(Transporter)
activate ServerHandler
note right of ServerHandler
  **Netty EventLoop 线程接收请求**
  通过 Channel 接收数据
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 提取 methodIdentifier
note right of ServerHandler
  **从 TransporterHeader 提取**
  methodIdentifier = "IWorkflowControlClient#manualTriggerWorkflow(...)"
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 检查心跳
alt 心跳请求
    ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 直接返回
    ServerHandler --> ServerChannel: 处理完成
else 正常请求
    ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 查找 ServerMethodInvoker
    note right of ServerHandler
      **根据方法标识符查找 ServerMethodInvoker**
      methodInvokerMap.get(methodIdentifier)
      从注册表中查找
    end note
    
    alt 方法未找到
        ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 构建错误响应
        ServerHandler -> ServerChannel: writeAndFlush(errorResponse)
        activate ServerChannel
        ServerChannel --> ServerHandler: 发送完成
        deactivate ServerChannel
        ServerHandler --> ServerChannel: 处理完成
    else 方法找到
        ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 提交到线程池执行
        note right of ServerHandler
          **在线程池中异步执行方法调用**
          methodInvokeExecutor.execute(() -> {...})
          避免阻塞 EventLoop 线程
        end note
    end
end

== 阶段6: 服务端处理请求（异步） ==

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 反序列化请求参数
note right of ServerHandler
  **反序列化 StandardRpcRequest**
  JsonSerializer.deserialize(transporter.getBody(), ...)
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 反序列化方法参数
note right of ServerHandler
  **将 JSON 反序列化为方法参数类型**
  循环反序列化每个参数
  JsonSerializer.deserialize(args[i], argsTypes[i])
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerInvoker: invoke(args)
activate ServerInvoker

ServerInvoker -> ServerInvoker: 使用反射调用方法
note right of ServerInvoker
  **使用反射调用实际的方法**
  method.invoke(serviceBean, args)
  method: IWorkflowControlClient#manualTriggerWorkflow
  serviceBean: WorkflowControlClient 实例
end note

ServerInvoker -> ServiceImpl: manualTriggerWorkflow(request)
activate ServiceImpl
note right of ServiceImpl
  **执行实际的业务逻辑**
  这是服务端的真实实现
end note

ServiceImpl -> ServiceImpl: 执行业务逻辑
ServiceImpl --> ServerInvoker: WorkflowManualTriggerResponse
deactivate ServiceImpl

ServerInvoker --> ServerHandler: result
deactivate ServerInvoker

== 阶段7: 服务端返回响应 ==

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 序列化返回值
note right of ServerHandler
  **将方法返回值序列化为 JSON**
  JsonSerializer.serialize(result)
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 构建响应
note right of ServerHandler
  **关键：使用请求的 opaque**
  TransporterHeader.of(transporter.getHeader().getOpaque(), methodIdentifier)
  opaque = 1 (与请求相同)
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerHandler: 创建 Transporter
note right of ServerHandler
  **响应包含：**
  - opaque = 1 (与请求相同)
  - methodIdentifier
  - body = 序列化后的结果
end note

ServerHandler -> ServerChannel: writeAndFlush(response)
activate ServerChannel
note right of ServerChannel
  **通过同一个 Channel 发送响应**
  响应中包含 opaque = 1
end note

ServerChannel -> TCP: 发送数据（TCP）
activate TCP
TCP -> ClientChannel: 接收数据（TCP）
activate ClientChannel
ClientChannel --> TCP: 数据接收完成
deactivate ClientChannel
TCP --> ServerChannel: 发送完成
deactivate TCP
ServerChannel --> ServerHandler: 发送成功（异步）
deactivate ServerChannel
ServerHandler --> ServerChannel: 处理完成
deactivate ServerHandler

== 阶段8: 客户端接收响应 ==

ClientChannel -> EventLoopThread: channelRead(Transporter)
activate EventLoopThread
note right of EventLoopThread
  **EventLoop 线程处理网络 I/O**
  线程名：NettyClientThread-1
  这是 Netty 的 I/O 线程，不是业务线程
end note

EventLoopThread -> NettyHandler: processReceived(transporter)
activate NettyHandler

NettyHandler -> NettyHandler: 提取 opaque
note right of NettyHandler
  **获取响应的 opaque**
  opaque = 1
end note

NettyHandler -> Future: getFuture(opaque=1)
activate Future
note right of Future
  **根据 opaque 查找 ResponseFuture**
  FUTURE_TABLE.get(1)
end note
Future --> NettyHandler: ResponseFuture (opaque=1)
deactivate Future

NettyHandler -> NettyHandler: 反序列化响应
NettyHandler -> NettyHandler: 反序列化响应体
note right of NettyHandler
  JsonSerializer.deserialize(body, StandardRpcResponse.class)
end note

NettyHandler -> Future: setIRpcResponse(response)
activate Future
Future -> Future: this.iRpcResponse = response
Future --> NettyHandler: 设置成功
deactivate Future

NettyHandler -> Future: putResponse(response)
activate Future
Future -> Future: this.iRpcResponse = response
Future -> Future: latch.countDown()
note right of Future
  **EventLoop 线程唤醒业务线程**
  CountDownLatch.countDown()
  阻塞的 waitResponse() 被唤醒
end note

Future -> Future: FUTURE_TABLE.remove(opaque=1)
Future --> NettyHandler: 响应已设置
deactivate Future

NettyHandler --> EventLoopThread: 处理完成
deactivate NettyHandler
EventLoopThread --> ClientChannel: 处理完成
deactivate EventLoopThread

== 阶段9: 客户端获取结果 ==

Future -> Future: waitResponse() 返回
activate Future
note right of Future
  **业务线程被唤醒**
  CountDownLatch 被唤醒
  返回 IRpcResponse
end note
Future --> RpcClient: IRpcResponse
deactivate Future

RpcClient --> ClientInvoker: IRpcResponse
deactivate RpcClient

== 阶段10: 处理响应并返回 ==

ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 检查响应是否成功
alt 响应成功
    ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 反序列化响应
    note right of ClientInvoker
      **将响应反序列化为方法返回类型**
      JsonSerializer.deserialize(response.getBody(), WorkflowManualTriggerResponse.class)
    end note
    ClientInvoker --> ClientHandler: WorkflowManualTriggerResponse
else 响应失败
    ClientInvoker -> ClientInvoker: 抛出 MethodInvocationException
    ClientInvoker --> ClientHandler: 异常
end

ClientInvoker --> ClientHandler: 结果或异常
deactivate ClientInvoker

ClientHandler -> ClientHandler: 处理异常（如果需要）
ClientHandler --> ProxyObject: 结果或异常
deactivate ClientHandler

ProxyObject --> ClientCode: WorkflowManualTriggerResponse
deactivate ProxyObject

== 总结 ==

note over ClientCode, ServiceImpl
  **JDK 动态代理 RPC 调用完整流程：**
  
  1. **代理对象创建**：使用 Proxy.newProxyInstance() 动态生成
  2. **方法拦截**：所有方法调用都被 InvocationHandler.invoke() 拦截
  3. **RPC 转换**：将方法调用转换为 RPC 请求
  4. **网络传输**：通过 Netty Channel 发送请求
  5. **服务端处理**：根据 methodIdentifier 查找并执行方法
  6. **响应返回**：通过相同的 Channel 返回响应
  7. **响应匹配**：通过 opaque 匹配请求和响应
  8. **结果返回**：反序列化响应并返回给客户端代码
  
  **关键点：**
  - 客户端使用代理对象，像调用本地方法一样调用远程服务
  - 服务端使用反射，根据方法标识符调用实际的方法实现
  - 通过 opaque 机制匹配请求和响应
  - 使用 CountDownLatch 实现线程间通信
end note

@enduml
